{"v":4,"catch":"讓那些可惡的老鼠安息吧！","desc":"《MOUSER》是UPL於1983年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n控制雄貓 Nyanta，從抓捕老鼠的人手中救出他的愛人 Mariya！\n狡猾的老鼠會帶著各種驚喜向你襲來。\nNyanta 需要你所有的運氣和幫助才能與他的未婚妻重歸於好！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-03-14","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2ddde24d51d6e530cff830975ea121aff4863f82753d865df34ce8a48a82d7ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1fde5cb13b4a16fd4ab0e3e7d038a00229120a14247d7ed3e86e0299109fa58c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69df31dd0a05baa38a6b60f3bb59ee46511a87973017f55044ecefee5d486e68.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59a5a5d6bbba78f71fae4c668fb5d6ea0b37970a05c145ac4e89a72dbb75d8f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b473a2d915ff1a7ce6511a5e9cfcb0c525028b94fc65bd2284f84d74f5879b2e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/41e972ccce2331193290595ffd662f8ed08c50491ae86b581fb200f327f9b672.jpg"],"titleId":"01008a001b41e000","dlc":[]}